#AI:1
TYPE="stack_meta"
STACK="php-laravel"
DISPLAY_NAME="PHP / Laravel"

DESCRIPTION:
Laravel web applications. Full-stack with Blade/Livewire or API-only
backends for SPA or mobile clients.

RECOMMENDED_TOOLS:
- Language:      PHP 8.3+
- Framework:     Laravel 11+
- Dependency:    Composer
- Test:          PHPUnit or Pest (Pest preferred for new projects)
- Lint:          PHP CS Fixer or Laravel Pint (Laravel's opinionated wrapper)
- Static:        PHPStan or Larastan

INIT_NOTES:
- init-project.sh copies code.ai → .claude/rules/code.ai
- init-project.sh copies tests.ai → .claude/rules/tests.ai
- Pin PHP version in .php-version or composer.json platform config
